WEBVTT

00:14:28.407 --> 00:14:30.182
We created public pensions.

00:14:30.182 --> 00:14:32.207
We created unions.

00:14:32.207 --> 00:14:34.723
Today, we are living through an era

00:14:34.723 --> 00:14:36.684
of economic transformation

00:14:36.684 --> 00:14:39.990
comparable in its scale and its scope

00:14:39.990 --> 00:14:42.258
to the Industrial Revolution.

00:14:42.258 --> 00:14:45.449
To be sure that this new economy benefits us all

00:14:45.449 --> 00:14:47.567
and not just the plutocrats,

00:14:47.567 --> 00:14:49.231
we need to embark on an era

00:14:49.231 --> 00:14:53.150
of comparably ambitious social and political change.

00:14:53.150 --> 00:14:55.808
We need a new New Deal.

00:14:55.808 --> 00:14:59.808
(Applause)